Package: fontboy
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: font browsing and preview application
 FontBoy is a font previewer: it lists the installed typefaces, shows
 character sets and sample pages, and renders single glyphs.
